le="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可当我们一同飞翔</span></p><p begin="10.885" end="16.565" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.885" end="11.205">We</span> <span begin="11.205" end="11.893">never</span> <span begin="11.893" end="16.565">knew</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却从未知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="12.946" end="17.552"><span begin="12.946" end="15.026">((Ooh</span> <span begin="15.026" end="17.552">ooh))</span></span></p><p begin="17.085" end="18.594" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.085" end="17.426">There</span> <span begin="17.426" end="17.805">in</span> <span begin="17.805" end="18.096">the</span> <span begin="18.096" end="18.594">air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在那片天空里</span></p><p begin="19.186" end="20.954" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.186" end="19.514">I</span> <span begin="19.514" end="19.874">felt</span> <span begin="19.874" end="20.146">her</span> <span begin="20.146" end="20.666">fea</span><span begin="20.666" end="20.954">thers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我触碰到她的羽翼</span></p><p begin="21.154" end="22.575" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.154" end="21.525">First</span> <span begin="21.525" end="21.896">all</span> <span begin="21.896" end="22.226">at</span> <span begin="22.226" end="22.575">once</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">先是一瞬之间</span></p><p begin="23.283" end="25.315" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.283" end="23.625">Then</span> <span begin="23.625" end="23.955">all</span> <span begin="23.955" end="24.243">to</span><span begin="24.243" end="24.803">ge</span><span begin="24.803" end="25.315">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再是紧紧相依</span></p><p begin="25.315" end="27.035" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.315" end="25.696">When</span> <span begin="25.696" end="26.016">I</span> <span begin="26.016" end="26.285">went</span> <span begin="26.285" end="27.035">through</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我穿透一切</span></p><p begin="27.473" end="32.884" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.473" end="27.763">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="27.763" end="28.145">when</span> <span begin="28.145" end="28.444">I</span> <span begin="28.444" end="32.884">knew</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一刻我才明白</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="29.485" end="33.184"><span begin="29.485" end="31.544">((Ooh</span> <span begin="31.544" end="33.184">ooh))</span></span></p><p begin="33.091" end="35.939" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.091" end="33.331">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="33.331" end="33.579">a</span> <span begin="33.579" end="34.070">killer</span> <span begin="34.070" end="34.331">and</span> <span begin="34.331" end="34.520">a</span> <span begin="34.520" end="35.160">killer</span> <span begin="35.160" end="35.390">is</span> <span begin="35.390" end="35.548">a</span> <span begin="35.548" end="35.939">bad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是个负心汉 可负心汉是个</span></p><p begin="35.939" end="36.950" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.939" end="36.200">Bad</span> <span begin="36.200" end="36.451">thing</span> <span begin="36.451" end="36.630">to</span> <span begin="36.630" end="36.950">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很糟糕的身份</span></p><p begin="37.259" end="39.240" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.259" end="37.459">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="37.459" end="37.720">a</span> <span begin="37.720" end="38.270">giver</span> <span begin="38.270" end="38.480">and</span> <span begin="38.480" end="38.670">a</span> <span begin="38.670" end="39.240">giver&apos;s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她一味付出</span></p><p begin="39.240" end="41.187" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.240" end="39.718">Even</span> <span begin="39.718" end="40.016">worse</span> <span begin="40.016" end="40.198">to</span> <span begin="40.198" end="40.506">folks</span> <span begin="40.506" end="40.787">like</span> <span begin="40.787" end="41.187">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我这样的人而言更为煎熬</span></p><p begin="41.380" end="44.221" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.380" end="41.501">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="41.501" end="41.941">I</span> <span begin="41.941" end="42.421">never</span> <span begin="42.421" end="42.760">really</span> <span begin="42.760" end="43.341">wanna</span> <span begin="43.341" end="43.712">be</span> <span begin="43.712" end="43.851">the</span> <span begin="43.851" end="44.221">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我真的不想</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="41.945" end="43.923"><span begin="41.945" end="42.934">((Ne</span><span begin="42.934" end="43.923">ver))</span></span></p><p begin="44.221" end="45.501" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.221" end="44.400">To</span> <span begin="44.400" end="44.731">hurt</span> <span begin="44.731" end="45.501">somebody</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤害任何人</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="43.964" end="45.543"><span begin="43.964" end="45.044">((Wanna</span> <span begin="45.044" end="45.543">be))</span></span></p><p begin="45.501" end="47.283" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.501" end="45.643">But</span> <span begin="45.643" end="45.951">it</span> <span begin="45.951" end="46.261">just</span> <span begin="46.261" end="46.512">keeps</span> <span begin="46.512" end="47.283">happening</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这一切却一再发生</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="45.543" end="47.682"><span begin="45.543" end="46.034">((Some</span><span begin="46.034" end="46.634">one</span> <span begin="47.155" end="47.682">why))</span></span></p><p begin="47.653" end="50.685" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.653" end="47.803">Yeah</span> <span begin="47.803" end="48.061">it</span> <span begin="48.061" end="48.333">just</span> <span begin="48.333" end="48.632">keeps</span> <span begin="48.632" end="49.523">happen</span><span begin="49.523" end="50.685">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是啊 一切总在重演</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="48.109" end="51.491"><span begin="48.109" end="51.491">((Why))</span></span></p><p begin="58.476" end="1:02.356" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.476" end="58.785">I</span> <span begin="58.785" end="59.156">was</span> <span begin="59.156" end="59.407">a</span> <span begin="59.407" end="59.927">bird</span> <span begin="1:00.516" end="1:00.905">he</span> <span begin="1:00.905" end="1:01.294">was</span> <span begin="1:01.294" end="1:01.585">an</span> <span begin="1:01.585" end="1:02.087">ar</span><span begin="1:02.087" end="1:02.356">row</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾是飞鸟 他曾是箭矢</span></p><p begin="1:02.591" end="1:06.489" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.591" end="1:02.940">I</span> <span begin="1:02.940" end="1:03.289">was</span> <span begin="1:03.289" end="1:04.089">allured</span> <span begin="1:04.089" end="1:04.391">by</span> <span begin="1:04.391" end="1:04.659">the</span> <span begin="1:04.659" end="1:05.049">straight</span> <span begin="1:05.049" end="1:05.420">and</span> <span begin="1:05.420" end="1:05.689">the</span> <span begin="1:05.689" end="1:06.191">nar</span><span begin="1:06.191" end="1:06.489">row</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我被那笔直而狭隘的轨迹所吸引</span></p><p begin="1:06.740" end="1:08.270" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.740" end="1:07.079">What</span> <span begin="1:07.079" end="1:07.460">could</span> <span begin="1:07.460" end="1:07.769">I</span> <span begin="1:07.769" end="1:08.270">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我该怎么办</span></p><p begin="1:08.820" end="1:13.900" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.820" end="1:09.180">His</span> <span begin="1:09.180" end="1:09.551">aim</span> <span begin="1:09.551" end="1:09.839">was</span> <span begin="1:09.839" end="1:13.900">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他目标明确</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:10.882" end="1:14.802"><span begin="1:10.882" end="1:12.933">((Ooh</span> <span begin="1:12.933" end="1:14.802">ooh))</span></span></p><p begin="1:15.023" end="1:16.522" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.023" end="1:15.394">Straight</span> <span begin="1:15.394" end="1:15.733">to</span> <span begin="1:15.733" end="1:16.023">the</span> <span begin="1:16.023" end="1:16.522">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直击心灵</span></p><p begin="1:17.093" end="1:18.933" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.093" end="1:17.493">I</span> <span begin="1:17.493" end="1:17.842">let</span> <span begin="1:17.842" end="1:18.093">it</span> <span begin="1:18.093" end="1:18.623">ha</span><span begin="1:18.623" end="1:18.933">ppen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只能听天由命</span></p><p begin="1:19.121" end="1:22.972" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.121" end="1:19.470">I</span> <span begin="1:19.470" end="1:19.822">coul</span><span begin="1:19.822" end="1:20.142">dn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:20.142" end="1:20.521">hard</span><span begin="1:20.521" end="1:20.942">ly</span> <span begin="1:20.942" end="1:21.230">have</span> <span begin="1:21.230" end="1:21.966">ever</span> <span begin="1:21.966" end="1:22.236">i</span><span begin="1:22.236" end="1:22.705">ma</span><span begin="1:22.705" end="1:22.972">gined</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我根本无法想象</span></p><p begin="1:22.972" end="1:25.002" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.972" end="1:23.242">That</span> <span begin="1:23.242" end="1:23.634">when</span> <span begin="1:23.634" end="1:23.972">he</span> <span begin="1:23.972" end="1:24.281">went</span> <span begin="1:24.281" end="1:24.663">through</span> <span begin="1:24.663" end="1:25.002">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当他看透我的心思时</span></p><p begin="1:25.002" end="1:27.023" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.002" end="1:25.303">He&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:25.303" end="1:25.652">hate</span> <span begin="1:25.652" end="1:26.042">what</span> <span begin="1:26.042" end="1:26.343">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:26.343" end="1:27.023">doin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会憎恨自己的所作所为</span></p><p begin="1:27.023" end="1:29.143" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.023" end="1:27.343">And</span> <span begin="1:27.343" end="1:27.802">make</span> <span begin="1:27.802" end="1:28.103">me</span> <span begin="1:28.103" end="1:28.442">feel</span> <span begin="1:28.442" end="1:29.143">stupid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让我觉得选择他</span></p><p begin="1:29.143" end="1:30.962" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.143" end="1:29.482">For</span> <span begin="1:29.482" end="1:30.134">choosin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:30.134" end="1:30.482">him</span> <span begin="1:30.482" end="1:30.962">too</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是个愚蠢的决定</span></p><p begin="1:31.032" end="1:32.101" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.032" end="1:31.152">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:31.152" end="1:31.392">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:31.392" end="1:31.643">a</span> <span begin="1:31.643" end="1:32.101">giver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我一味付出</span></p><p begin="1:32.101" end="1:34.872" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.101" end="1:32.323">And</span> <span begin="1:32.323" end="1:32.483">a</span> <span begin="1:32.483" end="1:33.093">giver</span> <span begin="1:33.093" end="1:33.333">is</span> <span begin="1:33.333" end="1:33.472">a</span> <span begin="1:33.472" end="1:33.893">bad</span> <span begin="1:33.893" end="1:34.173">bad</span> <span begin="1:34.173" end="1:34.432">thing</span> <span begin="1:34.432" end="1:34.573">to</span> <span begin="1:34.573" end="1:34.872">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一味付出本就是件糟糕透顶的事</span></p><p begin="1:35.141" end="1:37.240" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.141" end="1:35.411">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:35.411" end="1:35.701">a</span> <span begin="1:35.701" end="1:36.243">killer</span> <span begin="1:36.243" end="1:36.461">and</span> <span begin="1:36.461" end="1:36.661">a</span> <span begin="1:36.661" end="1:37.240">killer&apos;s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而他是个负心汉</span></p><p begin="1:37.240" end="1:39.091" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.240" end="1:37.581">Even</span> <span begin="1:37.581" end="1:37.920">worse</span> <span begin="1:37.920" end="1:38.109">for</span> <span begin="1:38.109" end="1:38.421">folks</span> <span begin="1:38.421" end="1:38.760">like</span> <span begin="1:38.760" end="1:39.091">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我这样的人而言更为煎熬</span></p><p begin="1:39.286" end="1:41.598" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.286" end="1:39.416">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:39.416" end="1:39.856">I</span> <span begin="1:39.856" end="1:40.357">never</span> <span begin="1:40.357" end="1:40.747">really</span> <span begin="1:40.747" end="1:41.246">wanna</span> <span begin="1:41.246" end="1:41.598">feel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我从来都不想</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:39.878" end="1:41.548"><span begin="1:39.878" end="1:40.868">((Ne</span><span begin="1:40.868" end="1:41.548">ver))</span></span></p><p begin="1:41.598" end="1:43.152" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.598" end="1:41.736">The</span> <span begin="1:41.736" end="1:42.118">hurt</span> <span begin="1:42.118" end="1:42.376">from</span> <span begin="1:42.376" end="1:43.152">anybody</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">体会受伤的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:41.966" end="1:43.228"><span begin="1:41.966" end="1:42.936">((Wanna</span> <span begin="1:42.936" end="1:43.228">Feel))</span></span></p><p begin="1:43.412" end="1:45.140" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.412" end="1:43.532">But</span> <span begin="1:43.532" end="1:43.852">it</span> <span begin="1:43.852" end="1:44.162">just</span> <span begin="1:44.162" end="1:44.420">keeps</span> <span begin="1:44.420" end="1:45.140">happening</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这一切却一再发生</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:43.424" end="1:45.572"><span begin="1:43.424" end="1:43.934">((The</span> <span begin="1:43.934" end="1:44.544">hurt</span> <span begin="1:44.881" end="1:45.572">why))</span></span></p><p begin="1:45.524" end="1:48.532" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.524" end="1:45.662">Yeah</span> <span begin="1:45.662" end="1:45.993">it</span> <span begin="1:45.993" end="1:46.332">just</span> <span begin="1:46.332" end="1:46.582">keeps</span> <span begin="1:46.582" end="1:47.598">happen</span><span begin="1:47.598" end="1:48.532">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是啊 一切总在重演</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:45.980" end="1:48.801"><span begin="1:45.980" end="1:48.801">((Why))</span></span></p><p begin="1:53.797" end="1:57.186" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.797" end="1:54.016">Yeah</span> <span begin="1:54.016" end="1:54.176">it</span> <span begin="1:54.176" end="1:54.546">just</span> <span begin="1:54.546" end="1:54.805">keeps</span> <span begin="1:54.805" end="1:55.819">happen</span><span begin="1:55.819" end="1:57.186">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是啊 一切总在重演</span></p><p begin="2:05.265" end="2:09.806" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.265" end="2:06.345">Fal</span><span begin="2:06.345" end="2:07.224">ling</sp